    description: "Split from WI-jusus's residual tail. Ruby class-level CONSTANTS, @@class-vars, and attr_accessor/reader/writer already emit (699239d969). Method-body instance variables (def foo; @x = 1; end) are not emitted as field symbols. Needs a design call on whether per-instance @ivars set in methods should be fields (cf. Python self.x own-field emission); fails-safe: emit none rather than wrong."  # 2f78
